==Trivia==
* In {{BotW}}, Fang and Bone will not disappear immediately once the time reaches 5:00 AM if Link waits. However, if Link talks to Kilton after this point, the latter will realize the time and the shop will vanish in a cutscene.
* In {{BotW|-}}, The sign above the shop window reads "Savage Swaps" in the [[Hylian (Language)|Hylian]] language.<ref>{{Cite|{{Script|Hylian BotW|Savage Swaps}}|Sign|BotW}}</ref>

